WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.389
Peter looked at Benjamin.

2
00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:13.359
"Silvertail is the nut thief!"

3
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.393
The bunnies ran to the squirrels.

4
00:00:17.394 --> 00:00:21.725
"We found the nut thief!" Peter said.

5
00:00:21.726 --> 00:00:24.357
"Go away!" a squirrel said.

6
00:00:24.358 --> 00:00:28.128
"This is not bunny business," another yelled.

7
00:00:28.129 --> 00:00:31.225
"It is squirrel business!"

8
00:00:31.226 --> 00:00:33.676
Timmy looked at the bunnies.

9
00:00:33.677 --> 00:00:37.369
"Who is the nut thief?" he asked.

10
00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:40.274
"Come with us," Benjamin said.

11
00:00:40.275 --> 00:00:43.928
"We will show you."

12
00:00:43.929 --> 00:00:55.161
Timmy followed the bunnies.

13
00:00:55.162 --> 00:01:00.628
They showed him Silvertail's hiding spot.

14
00:01:00.629 --> 00:01:02.940
Timmy's eyes got big.

15
00:01:02.941 --> 00:01:05.768
"Wow!" he said.

16
00:01:05.769 --> 00:01:09.222
"Silvertail is stealing our nuts!

17
00:01:09.223 --> 00:01:13.237
We must stop him."

18
00:01:13.238 --> 00:01:16.165
Benjamin saw a hollow tree.

19
00:01:16.166 --> 00:01:19.845
It had a hole in its trunk.

20
00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:26.663
"Hmm," Benjamin said. "I have an idea."

21
00:01:26.664 --> 00:01:33.002
The bunnies got some nuts.

22
00:01:33.003 --> 00:01:37.879
They hopped to the hollow tree.

23
00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:42.690
Then they pushed the nuts into the hole.

24
00:01:42.691 --> 00:02:01.237
"Now let's find Silvertail!" Benjamin said.

25
00:02:01.238 --> 00:02:03.881
Silvertail was taking a nap.

26
00:02:03.882 --> 00:02:13.361
"Hi, Silvertail!" Peter woke him up.

27
00:02:13.362 --> 00:02:16.165
"We found lots of nuts.

28
00:02:16.166 --> 00:02:18.589
Would you like some?"

29
00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:24.150
"Yes!" Silvertail licked his lips.

30
00:02:24.151 --> 00:02:28.330
"Where are they?"

